        },
        {
          "text": " “Abu kecorak yes kapak kaŋin ebe, ‘Kiinak EJAKAIT Ekusideke yes airum akwap na: ituboros ikapakina ejie kakonyen nuka ikusiinacan idwe luka Isirael, ituŋa kere luetitiŋ. ",
