              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu kecorak Yosua kapak kaŋin ebe, ‘Aanyut akonikonye kere nueswamaki EJAKAIT Ekonideke ikabakan ŋul luarei: iswamakini kwaŋin EJAKAIT ajakanuto kere nuitori ijo mamakec, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
