        },
        {
          "text": " ‘Wu EJAKAIT Edeke, igeu aitodikin ekonibulesit akonipolou ka akonikan nakagogoŋ: naarai iŋai edeke loejai toma akuj arai toma akwap, loepedori aswam kwape ejaatar akoniswamisio, ido kwape ejaatar akoniswamisio nukapedor? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
