          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye abu EJAKAIT kanyunyurik eoŋ kanukus, mam abu kapup eoŋ: katema EJAKAIT eoŋ atiar, “Kililiŋ; sirikiner bobo keoŋ akirot ŋin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
